{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition","id":1078625,"title":"[Ex3] Machineborn - An alternative setting to Exalted Third Edition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-14T16:28:20-07:00","id":1078625,"title":"[Ex3] Machineborn - An alternative setting to Exalted Third Edition","content":"<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><b>LINKS HAVE BEEN REMOVED!</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Machineborn will return in one form or another, but it will be completely unrelated to Exalted as a stand-alone project. </span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":482,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","user":"Ekorren","date":". 09-04-2018, 08:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T17:07:30-07:00","id":1078645,"title":"","content":"At first glad this looks amazing! Haven't gotten to really dive into it yet but I fully plan to. What inspired having so many of the nations/organizations divided up all over the world like that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T17:26:48-07:00","id":1078660,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1078645#post1078645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At first glad this looks amazing! Haven't gotten to really dive into it yet but I fully plan to. What inspired having so many of the nations/organizations divided up all over the world like that?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for showing interest in it. <br /> <br /> Some of the world factions are mirrors of Creation factions (the UN is the Realm, the UCoEA is an expanded Lookshy, Oceania is the Caul, the Haslan Dominion is the Haslanti League). I wanted some independent nations as well. At first I made the Y\u00f9 Dynasty into another part of UCoEA, but after some discussion with a friend, we figured out that the break-out of UCoEA (this makes sense after you've read that story in the PDF) would motivate China to break out independently. The idea that China used the calamity to seize more control in Asia made me create the Y\u00f9 Dynasty. Then finally Gran Colombia was added because I wanted something in South America and I wanted another major faction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T18:09:56-07:00","id":1078680,"title":"","content":"Haven't gotten to read it yet, but your layout looks beautiful! What program are you using for it?<br /> <br /> As far as the content goes, I'll try to take a look at it this weekend and give you a more cromulent discussion. =)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />&quot;The true object of all human life is play. Earth is a task garden; heaven is a playground.&quot; -G.K. Chesterton","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/53-blackwingedheaven","name":"blackwingedheaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar53_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T18:15:22-07:00","id":1078685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackwingedheaven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1078680#post1078680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Haven't gotten to read it yet, but your layout looks beautiful! What program are you using for it?<br /> <br /> As far as the content goes, I'll try to take a look at it this weekend and give you a more cromulent discussion. =)</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm using Adobe Indesign for the layout and Adobe Photoshop for the art. The majority of the art is licensed from Adobe Stock which gives me the freedom to modify the art to fit my purposes; for that I use Photoshop.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-14T19:09:26-07:00","id":1078710,"title":"","content":"I like the concept, but I feel like too much effort was made to make it mirror a high tech creation. I find the original content such as the new merits, charms, cybernetics, and such to be the most interesting aspects. <br /> <br /> Good work overall I think, I look forward to the guns section when it gets printed. <br /> <br /> One thing that might be worth looking into is the fact that Machine born are far easier to mass produce than Exalted, not to mention far more easily tailored to a specific purpose. Imagine a god-reaper, Trojan, or Prime Functionary that creates partial machine born protocols that allow formerly human operatives to function at the machine born level in a limited fashion (3-5 Solar ability protocol sets accessed, or maybe allowing them to get a single attribute of lunar protocols).<br /> <br /> Another thing to consider might be a machine born type that was never wholly human or machine. A vat born synthetic life form built from the ground up to be a machine born. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11837-a-not-quite-simple-soul","name":"A Not Quite Simple Soul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T00:30:43-07:00","id":1078794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>A Not Quite Simple Soul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1078710#post1078710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the concept, but I feel like too much effort was made to make it mirror a high tech creation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are there any particular hiccups in the mirroring that you dislike? I explained some of the reasons behind the mirroring in the Introduction Chapter. Having mirrored some aspects of the setting makes the transitions of mechanics easier. It's rare to find stuff in the corebook that can't be used in some way in the new setting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T01:23:17-07:00","id":1078806,"title":"","content":"Mostly the Scarlet empress analogue, and the whole bit with the apocalypse plague. It feels like a giant missed opportunity it doesn't really add much to the setting when maybe the focus should be on how the machine born interact with vast teeming hoards of post modern humans who aren't content to play second banana for the rest of eternity, and have education and technological access to make their views heard. I really liked how the Dragon born came about here as an attempt by humans to become more than minions for the AI developed Machineborn, very 'what if Lex Luthor didn't suffer from chronic supervillainitus?'<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11837-a-not-quite-simple-soul","name":"A Not Quite Simple Soul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T02:40:19-07:00","id":1078812,"title":"","content":"While I admit that I didn't read it fully, what I did read I enjoyed. The Snow Dove program was especially my favourite since it's great that you went through the trouble of creating an Exigent with very few guidelines currently existing and did such a great job with it. Nice job overall, looking forward to Dragons and more Exigents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11765-dominuete","name":"Dominuete","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T03:39:20-07:00","id":1078821,"title":"","content":"One minor thing is that it's a bit boring to have all the great house analogues simply called 'House name' Corporation. Sure, they're corporations, but corporations can still have more creative names, like 'Mnemon Shipping Incorporated' or 'Cynis Entertainment Conglomerate' and so on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some of me humble homebrew for ex3:<br /> <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hOOjEGyoq3owLoUwIwTfWKTffzo_udsiUTwomw7wudA/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Artifacts for Crumple's DB homebrew</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tI2T1Re0G8QOuoXkH7Y4PrKQxk1BPEGpbi82SpkTyIw/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Some Lintha QCs</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O2I_2iWTCflJ36ggkDvjTeXmzFsGHKRxAi6L_Ry6g4w/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A Wyld Behemoth</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8838-tds","name":"TDS","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T06:32:42-07:00","id":1078858,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TDS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1078821#post1078821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One minor thing is that it's a bit boring to have all the great house analogues simply called 'House name' Corporation. Sure, they're corporations, but corporations can still have more creative names, like 'Mnemon Shipping Incorporated' or 'Cynis Entertainment Conglomerate' and so on.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can understand that criticism. My perspective is that I wanted to go with simply the house name to establish the presence, but they are still mostly blank slates for now. While I've written some information about what kind of direction the corporations can take, they are still massive corporations that the players can do with as they please. For my games, I'm sure that Cynis Corp won't just be Cynis Corp. It will be Cynis Pharmaceuticals (big in the drug trade), Cynis Cybernetics (mostly fashionware), Cynis Entertainment (huge media corporation that produces celebrities), etc. There could be many sub-divisions of each company that specializes in certain fields. A bland name for the corp as a whole gives more creative freedom. <br /> <br /> I could write hundreds of pages to elaborate on the different corporations if I wanted to really delve into them, but I don't think it's necessary for this initial writeup. There are also a lot of them, and I think giving them more space right now would make it feel bloated. If I finish this project and people want more, I could easily expand on it with more setting info (I could even write corp-specific cybernetics and such).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T10:42:30-07:00","id":1078958,"title":"","content":"I'm kinda disappointed to find no analog for Gaia or Autochthon in the setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T11:18:46-07:00","id":1078970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1078958#post1078958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm kinda disappointed to find no analog for Gaia or Autochthon in the setting.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have ideas for Autochthon, but I didn't think it was important to add it at the moment. It's too far out there, literally. If I'd write him in, I'd make Autochthon into a space ship that was sent off earth to bring humanity out to distant stars. The Alchemicals would be the Machineborn created on that voyage. Then there's the potential for a portal to be opened from the ship and back to earth, kind of like Stargate Universe.<br /> <br /> How would you incorporate Gaia? I don't really think she's needed and I don't want to force her into the setting unless she adds something to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T22:50:04-07:00","id":1079247,"title":"","content":"This is absolutely great... and it's still a work in progress so more good things to come. I for one am looking forward to future developments.<br /> <br /> How often will it be updated? Will you be informing us whenever a new chapter or whatever is finished?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12555-japomann","name":"Japomann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12555_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T00:30:15-07:00","id":1079273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Japomann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1079247#post1079247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is absolutely great... and it's still a work in progress so more good things to come. I for one am looking forward to future developments.<br /> <br /> How often will it be updated? Will you be informing us whenever a new chapter or whatever is finished?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm writing on it pretty much every day. I don't want to overwhelm people with new updates and thread bumps though. I don't want to turn this into a thread where all the posts are made by me telling people I've updated something. I'll make the occasional bump with a list of things I've changed or added. You can also see the date for the last update in my signature. Same goes for other projects of mine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T03:59:03-07:00","id":1079317,"title":"","content":"Well, I've had a glance and I suppose the first thing I'll say is;<br /> <br /> You're a big fan of Shadowrun and Demon the Descent, aren't you?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T04:53:12-07:00","id":1079330,"title":"","content":"I really dig your production values, and I think you've obviously put a good deal of effort into this.<br /> <br /> For me, I have to say, kind of like Heaven's Reach, it doesn't really quite work. Aesthetically cyberpunk / space opera in the far / near future with Exalted like heroes running around, much yessage. Plus the 3e system might be good for that.<br /> <br /> But what I want in something like that is not to be kind of like going &quot;And why are there these Elemental Warriors in a world based in technology, and real actual physics (or at least, comic book physics!) and not the five elements? Why is are there animalistic shapechangers with moon powers? Why is this hierarchy of celestial over elemental power present when the mythology that backs that is sort of gone?&quot;. I get that these are not the literal things they are in Exalted, but it seems like why even have these fairly arbitrary feeling analogies to Exalted's magic that seem out of place in a world based closely on reality.<br /> <br /> I just think the goal works better to make up something a lot more loosely Exalted and more whole cloth (and probably redesigning your powers system). Or where you blend in Exalted more - like Exalted Modern does.<br /> <br /> This is totally preference though, so don't let this feedback get you down. Obviously YMMV, and some people will be able to squint a little and anything like the above is less an issue for them than having callbacks to canon Exalted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T05:12:40-07:00","id":1079333,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1079317#post1079317\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I've had a glance and I suppose the first thing I'll say is;<br /> <br /> You're a big fan of Shadowrun and Demon the Descent, aren't you?</div> </div> </div> </div>Never played Shadowrun and never read Demon the Descent. I have read the God-Machine Chronicle though, but that's as close as it gets. I'm more of a Cyberpunk 2020 fan and got into this with that in mind, but I ended up pivoting towards something with less of a retro feel. This setting is a bit of a hybrid between cyberpunk and high sci-fi. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ghosthead</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1079330#post1079330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really dig your production values, and I think you've obviously put a good deal of effort into this.<br /> <br /> For me, I have to say, kind of like Heaven's Reach, it doesn't really quite work. Aesthetically cyberpunk / space opera in the far / near future with Exalted like heroes running around, much yessage. Plus the 3e system might be good for that.<br /> <br /> But what I want in something like that is not to be kind of like going &quot;And why are there these Elemental Warriors in a world based in technology, and real actual physics (or at least, comic book physics!) and not the five elements? Why is are there animalistic shapechangers with moon powers? Why is this hierarchy of celestial over elemental power present when the mythology that backs that is sort of gone?&quot;. I get that these are not the literal things they are in Exalted, but it seems like why even have these fairly arbitrary feeling analogies to Exalted's magic that seem out of place in a world based closely on reality.<br /> <br /> I just think the goal works better to make up something a lot more loosely Exalted and more whole cloth (and probably redesigning your powers system). Or where you blend in Exalted more - like Exalted Modern does.<br /> <br /> This is totally preference though, so don't let this feedback get you down. Obviously YMMV, and some people will be able to squint a little and anything like the above is less an issue for them than having callbacks to canon Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heaven's Reach is one of the inspirations. I do acknowledge your criticism and I can see where you're coming from. This project is a creative exercise just as much as anything. I think a lot of people would enjoy it just like many people enjoyed the Shards. The setting is just fluff. Some people may be interested in just the systems (like the rules for using computers and vehicles and such), and this could provide a source for that as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T08:02:45-07:00","id":1079364,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ekorren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1079333#post1079333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Never played Shadowrun and never read Demon the Descent. I have read the God-Machine Chronicle though, but that's as close as it gets. I'm more of a Cyberpunk 2020 fan and got into this with that in mind, but I ended up pivoting towards something with less of a retro feel. This setting is a bit of a hybrid between cyberpunk and high sci-fi.</div> </div> </div> </div>If that's the case you'd enjoy both. And Numenera. And possibly KULT to a lesser extent. Oooh and Unknown Armies.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-17T16:41:43-07:00","id":1080079,"title":"","content":"<b>Deleted Post</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":482,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","user":"Ekorren","date":". 11-02-2017, 11:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-18T10:19:28-07:00","id":1080408,"title":"","content":"So just got home after easter, saw this, and I regret I can only like the first post once. So i'm gonna like every one of your posts in this thread. This is amazing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-26T13:12:13-07:00","id":1084119,"title":"","content":"Another deleted post.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":482,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","user":"Ekorren","date":". 11-02-2017, 11:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-28T04:40:39-07:00","id":1084963,"title":"","content":"I love love love love the aesthetic and setting. So good. I've always loved sci-fi/cyberpunk aesthetics, and meshing it with Heroes in a Dark Age is such brilliance!<br /> <br /> Also, technology and protocols are great! I'll read into them in detail soon. I'll hopefully use some of these as inspiration for my own Ex3-System based settings. Here's hoping my players would be up to play this in the first place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9947-blackwoodcoven","name":"BlackwoodCoven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9947_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T04:51:14-07:00","id":1114111,"title":"","content":"Machineborn should now be playable for mortal characters, but it's still lacking content for Machineborn characters. I'm running a playtest at the moment and will be updating the document more regularly. As of me writing this, it is 127 pages long and includes a 3-page character sheet for mortal characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T01:52:36-07:00","id":1114479,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ekorren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1084119#post1084119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>- Added the God-Ware 'Adorei-chan'. &lt;---- If you're going to read something, read that one. </b></div> </div> </div> </div>*chuckles*<br /> I was rather unprepared for that.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T13:55:49-07:00","id":1133538,"title":"","content":"<b>A LOT</b> has happened since last time.<br /> <br /> The game is playable for mortals. It only needs more setting stuff and more overall content, but it has enough to be playable. The current version is <b>134</b> pages, and that's <b>after</b> I decided to remove all of the Machineborn mechanics. I have decided to put all of the Machineborn mechanics in supplement PDFs instead, starting by collecting my dozens and dozens of pages of Solar Machineborn mechanics into a playable Solar supplement. But before I work on that one, I plan to finish the blank spots in the core PDF.<br /> <br /> Download it, skim it, and tell me what you think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":482,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","user":"Ekorren","date":". 08-24-2017, 05:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-02T21:15:31-07:00","id":1155279,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:26px\">THE BOOK IS DONE!</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">This took a while.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-03T00:17:45-07:00","id":1155317,"title":"","content":"Holy shit this is dense.<br /> <br /> I'm going to read this over the course of the next few days.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T13:00:16-08:00","id":1156140,"title":"","content":"So far this is amazing. I am not 100% sold on Composure and the Humanity track but I love the setting and everything you did here.<br /> <br /> <b>Note About InDesign</b>: I would add a bit of downsizing on the art when exporting to .pdf. Maybe reduce it to 300 DPI or less, right now the .pdf is 82M and I am guessing that's due to the amount of art at full DPI.<br /> <br /> Also, will you PoD this? I want to hold the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":12102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","user":"Maudova","date":". 11-05-2017, 04:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T17:30:32-08:00","id":1156197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maudova</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1156140#post1156140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, will you PoD this? I want to hold the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>I`d be very careful about actually attempting this. Most publishing companies are not okay with fan supplements being for money. I`d check with OPP before doing anything with a payment option.<br /> <br /> Cool supplement though!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T20:09:13-08:00","id":1156228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1156197#post1156197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I`d be very careful about actually attempting this. Most publishing companies are not okay with fan supplements being for money. I`d check with OPP before doing anything with a payment option.<br /> <br /> Cool supplement though!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Valid Point. I wonder, if there is only a Publisher/Shipping cost and zero profit is made, could it be done?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T00:06:24-08:00","id":1156249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maudova</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1156140#post1156140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So far this is amazing. I am not 100% sold on Composure and the Humanity track but I love the setting and everything you did here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you. I appreciate the feedback.<br /> <br /> What is it about Composure and Humanity that you're having doubts about?<br /> <br /> In my experience playing the game, Composure is one of the most important and more rolled Attributes in the game right now. It's both used similar to how it's used in Chronicles/World of Darkness (I asked a player to roll it out of frustration when he was wrongfully arrested by a corporation his character had been working against because it felt like he lost all sense of control over the situation). It can also be used as a Social Attribute for non-verbal communication (I've often asked another player to roll Composure as the Attribute to help him with intimidation actions when he wants to threaten people by pointing guns at them and looking mean). I feel it's a versatile and useful trait.<br /> <br /> As for Humanity, I have a few concerns after playtesting. I added the feature both as a reference to Chronicles/World of Darkness, but also as a reference to Cyberpunk 2020 (which is one of the inspirations). From my experience, players either tend to have extremely low Humanity or extremely high Humanity depending on how much they value Composure, Willpower and Integrity. Because it's so easy to get a high Humanity score, I can sometimes feel like I've balanced the Humanity erosion from cybernetics too low, since a full borg alpha frame only erodes 5.3 Humanity (which in my mind when writing it seemed much more than it actually turned out to be).<br /> <br /> I like the idea of Humanity to portray how a character can distance himself from his sense of humanity through cybernetic addiction and things like that. I may need to balance the Humanity erosion from cybernetics differently to make it feel like more of a cost to add powerful implants. I've been thinking about utilizing Humanity for effects similar to Limit Break too, but I'm a bit skeptical about that still since doing so could make players feel too compelled to invest in those traits instead of other traits.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maudova</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1156140#post1156140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Note About InDesign</b>: I would add a bit of downsizing on the art when exporting to .pdf. Maybe reduce it to 300 DPI or less, right now the .pdf is 82M and I am guessing that's due to the amount of art at full DPI.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a fair point. I've never done anything of this scale before so reducing the DPI didn't even occur to me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maudova</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1156140#post1156140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, will you PoD this? I want to hold the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would want a physical copy as well, but homebrew is a gray area to begin with, and you can only go as far as the license owners let you. I'm sure it would be fine to print a physical copy for your own personal use, but you can't really do it for profit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":482,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","user":"Ekorren","date":". 11-06-2017, 06:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-07T14:42:35-08:00","id":1156799,"title":"","content":"So I can't type a comprehensive reply right now as I am at work on break, but two of my points of contention with adding composure and using humanity are attribute-based exalts and Alchemical cybernetics (read charms). So Lunars, Getemians, and Alchemicals (as far as I can recall) will be impacted by a lack of the appearance charms, you'll have to shift and maneuver them into another attribute. Which seems like a huge headache. Second Alchemicals are the Cyborg Exalts and their basic charms are essentially cybernetic enhancements on steroids. So if cybernetics degrades humanity what will happen to Alchemicals (which are double stuck by a move attribute and humanity hit for just being themselves).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-07T19:20:47-08:00","id":1156868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maudova</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1156799#post1156799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I can't type a comprehensive reply right now as I am at work on break, but two of my points of contention with adding composure and using humanity are attribute-based exalts and Alchemical cybernetics (read charms). So Lunars, Getemians, and Alchemicals (as far as I can recall) will be impacted by a lack of the appearance charms, you'll have to shift and maneuver them into another attribute. Which seems like a huge headache. Second Alchemicals are the Cyborg Exalts and their basic charms are essentially cybernetic enhancements on steroids. So if cybernetics degrades humanity what will happen to Alchemicals (which are double stuck by a move attribute and humanity hit for just being themselves).</div> </div> </div> </div>Attribute-based Machineborn are positively affected by Composure because it is a more varied Attribute than Appearance has ever been. It makes it difficult to directly convert Charms, but it gives more creative freedom to create new Protocols. Humanity won't affect Alchemicals at all. They already have the exact same feature called Clarity. I wrote an example Alchemical in the Adversaries chapter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T15:04:30-08:00","id":1159579,"title":"","content":"So I did something smart and compressed the art. The document went from 82mb to 26mb with no noticeable drop in quality. I should have figured that one out earlier. Would have saved a lot of processing time. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T07:57:38-08:00","id":1159848,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ekorren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1078625-ex3-machineborn-an-alternative-setting-to-exalted-third-edition?p=1159579#post1159579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I did something smart and compressed the art. The document went from 82mb to 26mb with no noticeable drop in quality. I should have figured that one out earlier. Would have saved a lot of processing time. :P</div> </div> </div> </div>So, I\u2019ll make this note. When/if you send this to print it\u2019ll need to be 300dpi+. For digital 150-300 is a safe bet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-01T17:22:12-08:00","id":1164433,"title":"","content":"So has anyone read (some of) this and have any comments or questions about setting, system, stuff? It's a big book so I can't even get my own players to read it in full even though we play the damn thing. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","cust